{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-005", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "新工单开工是2.0版重新首件确认的触发情形之一。[资料1]\n更换定位治具是2.0版重新首件确认的触发情形之一。[资料1]\n连续停机超过4小时后重新开工是2.0版重新首件确认的触发情形之一。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "591a696b559d8e019b0d26859f9ca95c257b783bdd10395d071c3bb6798f962f", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true, "snapshot_observed": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "raw_sha256": "61f1c70ddb2a078ea640a48ef7ae3003e842bf4181ff16654854753edc0453c9"}
{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-006", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "按2.0版规定，触发条件是“连续停机超过4小时”，因此恰好4小时不满足该条件，不会触发此条款。[资料1]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料1", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "591a696b559d8e019b0d26859f9ca95c257b783bdd10395d071c3bb6798f962f", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true, "snapshot_observed": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "raw_sha256": "d850d202288ca4a6aea78d16f4a03afdcf1422da9f3830bcae8764a203307005"}
{"case_id": "MFG-GOLD-007", "result": {"status_code": 200, "body": {"answer": "按2.0版规定，连续停机超过4小时后重新开工时，必须重新进行首件确认。[资料3]\n首件确认必须连续检查3件，且所有必检项目全部合格。[资料3]\n首件检验必须由质量人员进行签署，不允许只检1件或用操作员口头确认替代质量签署。[资料3]\n只有在首件确认完成、记录齐全且质量人员完成签署后，才能恢复后续作业。[资料2]", "answerable": true, "refusal_reason": null, "response_type": "answer", "citations": [{"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "2.0", "citation_id": "资料3", "document_id": "c6df0cb7-0e60-41ac-93df-c07746a40189", "document_name": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "section_path": "07_HC-A17_OP20作业指导书现行版.docx", "chunk_id": "f85946e551b3b07c7129a8191bf6603b3dc23fc8b23a92c529e7d0ebbcfca393", "parent_id": "7420a2650f51bc0011b3bb911492b355b8c0556255260e1fc8520c95b58b0fe8", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}, {"document_version": 1, "business_revision": "1.0", "citation_id": "资料2", "document_id": "b64b8bb8-0b44-4f53-8c76-d1a8a9a39976", "document_name": "02_首件确认与工序交接流程.pdf", "section_path": "02_首件确认与工序交接流程.pdf", "chunk_id": "0e2cbc0c759882d83c0bae524b0b7336236855cf7d9d20e964e893e261568dcf", "parent_id": "4e87d343f6c42b5d154833569c6a314a49e19e65132f7f1f53e9ec1ec294531c", "knowledge_base_id": "2a29982a-9b3c-41b5-abca-22473521b2ca", "knowledge_base_name": "生产工艺"}]}}, "contract": {"checks": {"http_status": true, "answerable": true, "has_answer": true, "has_source": true, "snapshot_observed": true}, "passed": true, "semantic_score": false, "semantic_review": "requires_assistant_non_independent_per_fact_review"}, "harness_error": null, "raw_sha256": "bb94c4aafdeea15da5f554a2f4863d29bf9efa5785600338458ac6743632be72"}
